      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We studied 14 subjects (7 normal and 7 with coronary artery disease) and we analysed the changes in same parameters (FC, PAD, PAS, PEP, PE, PEP, PEP/PE, SEM) 5m' and 15m' after isosorbide dinitrate. The results demonstrated an improvement of the parameters studied without any side effect."},
